Lint directives are invisible in rendered content

```
%% carve-lint-disable empty-link-destination

[x]()
.
<p><a href="">x</a></p>
```

```
# One

### Three %% carve-lint-disable-line heading-level-skip
.
<section id="One">
  <h1>One</h1>
  <section id="Three">
    <h3>Three</h3>
  </section>
</section>
```

